Planned: CirclePacking(Example) exposing build(cfg) -> Example.

  - validator.py holds validate_packing(); its source is injected into both the
    prompt and the sandbox prelude, as in the reference implementation
  - transition: extract the ```python block, prepend the prelude
  - verify: run entrypoint (example.params.entrypoint), validate, reward = sum
    of radii, feedback = traceback or the validator's rejection message
  - all knobs (num_circles, target, entrypoint) come from example.params
